            <div xml:id="d641">

                <pb facs="0757" n="655" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg655"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">693.003/535: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chairman of the American Delegation</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Arnold</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                            State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-12-23"><hi rendition="#italic">December 23,
                            1918</hi>.</date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received December 24,
                            8.58 a.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Tariff Commissions sessions concluded. Delegates unanimously agreed recommending
                    to respective Governments adoption Commission’s proposed revised tariff.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Arnold</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
